1
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,840
每人一份意大利蛋饼
Ooh! Individual frittatas!

2
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:07,020
规格真高 你真幸运 菲尔
What a treat. You're a lucky man, Phil.

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,540
-我一直这么说 我... -菲尔
- I'm always saying, I'm... - Phil.

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,200
-抱歉 -你又把牛奶放外边了
- Sorry. - You left the milk out again.

5
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,240
我得带一个回家吃
I may have to take one of these little guys home.

6
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,860
克莱尔 你找到我借你的保鲜盒了吗
Claire, did you ever find that Tupperware I lent you?

7
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,160
亲爱的 跟你说过一百遍了
Sweetie, for the hundredth time,

8
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,620
我还给你了 记得吗
I gave it back to you, remember?

9
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,200
我是记得你说过一百遍
I remember you telling me a hundred times,

10
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,180
可我现在都只能用塑料袋盛豌豆汤
yet my pea soup is in baggies.

11
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,800
你检查过车子吗
Did you check your car?

12
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:24,900
在那个
In the...

13
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:25,200
后备箱里
Trunk.

14
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,940
上次你就是在那里找到了
Because that's where you found that thing

15
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:29,000
那个你以为早就给我了的东西
that you thought that you gave me long time ago,

16
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,600
-那个 那个 -披萨刀
- the... the... - Pizza cutter.

17
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,180
-是的 那次是我错了 -就一团塑料而已
- Yes, I was wrong that time. I-- - It's a piece of plastic.

18
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:35,340
你把早午餐毁了
You're ruining brunch.

19
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,400
别想太多了 小卡
Don't sweat it, Cam.

20
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:37,620
我也老是忘事儿
I forget things all the time.

21
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,820
比如我就老是记不住
Like I can never remember the name

22
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:42,820
我喜欢的那个天气播报员的名字
of that weather guy that I liked. Uh...

23
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,320
什么雷 什么风的
Thunder something. Stormy...

24
00:00:44,478 --> 00:00:46,359
闪电风暴 管他叫什么呢
Flash Stormy? Ah, whatever the hell it is.

25
00:00:46,488 --> 00:00:48,339
-我不知道 -吃你的蛋吧 杰
- I don't know. - Mm, just eat your eggs, Jay.

26
00:00:48,467 --> 00:00:50,377
对 吃你的蛋吧 杰
Yeah, just eat your eggs, Jay.

27
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,560
爷爷受到教训了
Grandpa got told!

28
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,020
看他们那样
Look at them.

29
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,680
所有人都觉得莉莉超可爱
They all think Lily's so great.

30
00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:00,060
新鲜感总会消失的
The novelty will wear off.

31
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:01,680
我们以前才是家里最萌的
We used to be the cute ones.

32
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:03,420
现在注意力全集中在她身上了
Now she gets all the attention.

33
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:05,380
我们得灭了她
We need to take her down.

34
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:07,000
我应该记得他的名字的
And I should remember his name, too,

35
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,360
因为你妈和我为他还大吵了一架
because your mom and I got in a big fight over him.

36
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,040
她那时候开着敞篷车 我跟她说
She was using the convertible, and I told her,

37
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:17,080
把顶篷升上来 那谁说今晚会下雨的
"Put the top up because it's supposed to rain tonight, according to..."

38
00:01:17,707 --> 00:01:18,794
那人叫 部分·多云
P-p-p-partly McCloudy?

39
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:20,240
管他叫什么破名呢 反正呢
Whatever the hell his name is. Anyway...

40
00:01:20,917 --> 00:01:22,065
她没照做 车毁了
She didn't. Ruined the car.

41
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:25,120
我说这话不是因为我总帮我妈说话
Well, not to be the one that always come to mom's defense...

42
00:01:26,180 --> 00:01:27,580
干吗呢 都20年前的事了
What? It was 20 years ago.

43
00:01:27,778 --> 00:01:28,940
怎么了 难道他现在还会关你禁闭啊
What, you think he's gonna ground you?

44
00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:29,500
是你干的
It was you?

45
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:32,160
是的 是的 是我把顶蓬放下来
Yes. Yes, I left the top down,

46
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,660
让妈妈背了黑锅
and I let mom take the fall.

47
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:35,260
害得他俩离婚了
And then they got divorced.

48
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,700
-12年以后才离的 -我就这么一说
- 12 years later. - I'm just saying.

49
00:01:36,739 --> 00:01:37,705
你毁了早午餐
Ugh. You're ruining brunch.

50
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:39,240
放轻松 那都好多年前的事了
Relax. It was years ago.

51
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:41,100
这种事也有个追诉时效的嘛
There's a statute of limitation on this stuff.

52
00:01:41,180 --> 00:01:42,800
既然这样 我干脆告诉你们
In that case, I should probably let you know

53
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:45,560
我把顶篷放下来是为了散一下烟味
I let the top down to let out the cigarette smoke.

54
00:01:47,049 --> 00:01:48,116
不是我抽的 不是我
Not--not mine. Not mine.

55
00:01:48,253 --> 00:01:49,510
是我一个坏朋友伊利诺
My--my bad friend Eleanor.

56
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:51,400
所谓伊利诺其实是她男朋友艾伦
Eleanor being her boyfriend Allen.

57
00:01:51,580 --> 00:01:52,620
追诉时效
Statute of limitations.

58
00:01:52,652 --> 00:01:54,036
放松点 没事的
Oh, relax, it's okay.

59
00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:55,460
记不记得我告诉你们
Remember when I told you

60
00:01:55,460 --> 00:01:57,900
说我不能赶去看你们花样滑冰的半决赛
that I couldn't get to your figure skating semifinal

61
00:01:57,900 --> 00:01:58,980
是因为工作脱不开身
because I was stuck at work?

62
00:01:59,080 --> 00:01:59,260
记得
Yeah.

63
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:00,920
所谓脱不开身其实是烂醉如泥
Well, by "stuck" I meant "drunk,"

64
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,560
所谓工作 其实是在高尔夫球场
and by "work" I meant "the golf course."

65
00:02:04,183 --> 00:02:06,097
-老爸 不是吧 -我想起来一件事
- Wow. Dad! Oh, no. - I got one. I got one.

66
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,780
记不记得那次我们一块去打高尔夫
Remember that time we went golfing together,

67
00:02:08,889 --> 00:02:10,411
-你一杆进洞来着 -记得啊
- and you got a hole-in-one? - Yeah?

68
00:02:10,648 --> 00:02:11,695
你其实没打出一杆进洞
You never got a hole-in-one.

69
00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:13,820
是我闲着无聊 把球踢进洞里了
I got bored and I kicked it in the hole.

70
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:17,700
这可真有意思 我来说点更好玩的
This is fun. Here's a corker.

71
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:20,520
医院以前可不像现在这样给婴儿贴姓名标签牌
They didn't used to label babies as carefully in hospitals,

72
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,060
-在两天之内 -现在不是时候 菲尔
- so for two days-- - Not now, Phil.

73
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:23,800
你什么意思 是你把球踢进洞里去的
What do you mean, you-- you kicked the ball in the hole?

74
00:02:23,940 --> 00:02:24,881
怎么 当时那球 是在洞边上吗
What, was it, like, on the edge?

75
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:26,360
是啊 是在那个
Yeah, it was on the edge of that, uh...

76
00:02:26,588 --> 00:02:27,663
那什么 在那沙丘边上
What? That--that sandy thing.

77
00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:30,060
老天 我今天可怎么去面对我的朋友们呢
Gee, it's sure gonna be fun to face my friends today.

78
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,240
你不一定非得告诉他们啊
Well, you don't have to tell them.

79
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:32,880
他们叫我"高手"呢 米奇
They call me "Ace," Mitch.

80
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:35,380
我在那地方免费喝了二十年的柠檬水
I haven't paid for a lemonade down there in 20 years.

81
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,420
你生我的气了
You're mad at me?

82
00:02:39,260 --> 00:02:40,884
这下可好 老爸 你毁了早午餐
Great, daddy. You ruined brunch.

83
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:44,460
确实是
You did!

84
00:02:45,380 --> 00:02:46,660
这事今天得有个了结
This ends today.

85
00:03:01,420 --> 00:03:02,820
能帮点忙吗
A little help here?

86
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:04,180
米兰达·康奈尔就住在街角
You can't expect me to focus

87
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:06,220
你怎么能指望我集中精神呢
when Miranda Cornell lives right down your street.

88
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,800
她简直就是包裹在牛仔打底裤里的美梦
She's like a dream wrapped in a wish poured into jeggings.

89
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,960
是的是的 是挺美好的
Yeah, yeah, that's nice and all,

90
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,720
我们还得做个机关呢
but we got a trap to set.

91
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:14,420
你确定这能有用吗
Are you sure this is going to work?

92
00:03:14,740 --> 00:03:17,240
相信我 我们用饼干作为诱饵
Trust me. We'll use these cookies as bait.

93
00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:18,920
莉莉可爱吃了
Lily's crazy for them.

94
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,180
据说亚洲人新陈代谢比较快
Asian metabolism.

95
00:03:20,454 --> 00:03:22,809
等她用那肮脏的小手去抓饼干的时候
When she grabs them with her grubby little hands,

96
00:03:22,900 --> 00:03:24,100
触动机关
off goes the trap.

97
00:03:24,542 --> 00:03:26,441
砰 一大滩牛奶
Boom--big puddle of milk.

98
00:03:26,693 --> 00:03:27,959
她会有大麻烦的
She'll get in so much trouble.

99
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,440
我妈可讨厌一团乱了
My mom hates messes.

100
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:31,060
我知道克莱尔是什么样的人
I'm familiar with Claire.

101
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:32,280
准备
Lock...

102
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:34,320
待发
And loaded.

103
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,340
这饼干太好吃了
These cookies are so good...

104
00:03:38,340 --> 00:03:40,600
又这么触手可及
And so easy to reach.

105
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,000
莉莉
Lily!

106
00:03:54,432 --> 00:03:56,282
我的天呐 小卡
Oh, my god! Cam! Oh! Ohh!

107
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:59,020
怎么回事 你还好吧
What happened? Are you okay?

108
00:03:59,260 --> 00:04:02,980
那盒牛奶 倒了 我肯定是踩滑了
Oh! That milk... Fell, and I must have slipped in it!

109
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,180
我又把牛奶忘在外边了吗 实在抱歉
Did I leave that out again? I'm so sorry!

110
00:04:05,180 --> 00:04:06,920
我的背 哎哟 我的背
Oh! My back! Ooh! My back!

111
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:10,040
帮你做个瑞典式按摩好吗 口音您挑
Can I give you a Swedish massage, accent optional?

112
00:04:10,169 --> 00:04:12,427
不用了 让我躺会儿就行
Oh! Oh, no, I just need to lie down.

113
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,980
来吧 我们扶你去沙发那儿歇歇
Come on. Let's just get you over to the sofa.

114
00:04:15,756 --> 00:04:16,649
你觉得让闺女帮我踩背
Do you think it would be offensive

115
00:04:16,660 --> 00:04:18,160
这个要求过分吗
if I asked our daughter to walk on my back?

116
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:20,920
有点 我刚刚不是说帮你按吗
I'd say so. I just offered to give you a massage.

117
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:24,140
不会吧 碧翠丝被你弄坏了
Oh, no! You broke Beatrice.

118
00:04:24,500 --> 00:04:26,580
这下她没法喂海豚了
Now she can't feed the dolphins.

119
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,140
这孩子说什么呢
What is she talking about?

120
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:29,720
这是"甜蜜相伴"家的娃娃
Oh, it's a "My sweet companion" doll.

121
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,220
娃娃的背景故事都经过精心安排
They all have these elaborate backstories.

122
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:33,840
碧翠丝跟盲眼的海豚和模特是同事
Beatrice works with blind dolphins and models.

123
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,920
还有盲人模特吗
There are blind models?

124
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:39,740
真惨 都看不见自己有多漂亮
That's so sad. They cannot see how pretty they are.

125
00:04:42,132 --> 00:04:43,524
好的 慢点 来吧
Okay. Hold on. Here we go.

126
00:04:43,524 --> 00:04:45,293
扶稳了 扶稳了 扶稳了
Give me some. Give me some. Give me some. Oh!

127
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,560
我给莉莉买个新娃娃吧
Let me buy Lily a new doll.

128
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:50,040
小卡摔倒都是我的错
It's my fault Cam fell.

129
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:52,264
不用啦 "甜蜜相伴"店里
No, no need. Uh, the "My sweet companion" store

130
00:04:52,264 --> 00:04:54,620
有个医院 里面有位值班医生
actually has a hospital with an on-call doctor.

131
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:56,600
我可以送她去 正好要带姑娘们去商场
Well, I can go. I'm taking the girls to the mall anyway.

132
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:57,880
那就太好了
Oh, that'd be great. Yeah.

133
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,280
别担心 娃娃有医保的
And don't worry. She has medical insurance.

134
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:01,680
我觉得咱今年应该达到免赔额了吧
Yeah, and I think we've met our deductible for the year,

135
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,620
所以应该不用花钱的
so you should be good.

136
00:05:02,820 --> 00:05:03,260
没错
Yeah.

137
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:05,320
你们知道我们村里的娃娃啥样吗
Do you know what a doll is in my village?

138
00:05:05,580 --> 00:05:07,120
叉子顶个苹果就算
An apple on a fork.

139
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:13,180
我都没玩过娃娃 这样很怪异吗
I never really got dolls. Does that make me weird?

140
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,280
绝对在"怪异名单"上
It's on the list.

141
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:15,240
你一点也不怪异
You're not weird.

142
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:17,400
你只是直接越过了小女孩阶段罢了
You just kind of skipped the little girl stage.

143
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:20,460
直接跳到"你敢按她门铃试试"阶段
And jumped to the "I dare you to ring her doorbell" stage.

144
00:05:20,460 --> 00:05:23,000
您这辈子也就只有往钢管舞台上跳的命
The only stage you're ever going to jump on has a pole on it.

145
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,440
好歹我也有本钱啊
Hey, at least I have the body--

146
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,640
别吵 别吵
Okay! Okay!

147
00:05:25,651 --> 00:05:28,320
我们要把这事移送法庭
We're gonna have to settle this dispute in court--

148
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:29,200
美食广场
The food court.

149
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:31,780
由尊敬的"肉桂卷"法官审理
The honorable judge Cinnabon presiding.

150
00:05:31,780 --> 00:05:33,140
美食广场吗
The food court?

151
00:05:33,260 --> 00:05:35,580
那地方一股卢克的自行车头盔味儿
That place smells like the inside of Luke's bicycle helmet.

152
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,620
-我喜欢美食广场 -我也喜欢
- I like the food court. - Me, too.

153
00:05:37,620 --> 00:05:39,771
别担心 姑娘们 我们才不会因为
Don't worry, girls. We're not gonna deprive ourselves

154
00:05:39,771 --> 00:05:42,044
海莉对食物无爱就亏待自己
just 'cause of Haley's aversion to food--

155
00:05:43,901 --> 00:05:46,560
哦哦 你说无爱啊
Oh. Oh, Haley's "Aversion."

156
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:49,000
我还以为你说
I thought you said...

157
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:49,460
当我没说
Never mind.

158
00:05:57,780 --> 00:06:00,280
好的 你打开电视之后
Okay, so after you have turned on the monitor

159
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:01,540
选择输入模式后
and selected your input,

160
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:03,920
就可以用这只换台了
you can change the channel with this guy.

161
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,480
但如果你要调节音量
But if you need to change the volume--

162
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,560
你知道吗 我觉得我这样挺好
You know what? I think I'm fine.

163
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,580
你忙你的去吧
Why don't you just go ahead?

164
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:09,940
我知道听起来很复杂
I know this sounds really confusing,

165
00:06:09,940 --> 00:06:12,120
但我有个简单易上手的小诀窍
but there's actually a very simple way to remember it.

166
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:14,836
输入模式一是机顶盒
Input 1 is the cable box

167
00:06:14,836 --> 00:06:16,966
-机顶盒 机 -我觉得我打个盹就好
- Cable box, ca-- - I think I'm just gonna take a nap.

168
00:06:16,966 --> 00:06:18,707
那行 我去做瑜伽了
Okay. I'm going to yoga.

169
00:06:18,822 --> 00:06:21,339
哇 听起来蛮有趣的啊
Ay! That sounds like so much fun.

170
00:06:21,350 --> 00:06:22,860
你应该跟她一起去 歌洛莉亚
Oh, you should go with her, Gloria!

171
00:06:22,860 --> 00:06:24,480
以后有机会一定会的
Oh, we should definitely do that sometime.

172
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:25,720
我会很乐意的 拜
I would love it. Bye!

173
00:06:26,696 --> 00:06:29,207
看见她怎么用冷屁股贴我热脸了吧
Do you see how she gives me the cold shoulders?

174
00:06:29,300 --> 00:06:31,540
我都不知道自己还试个什么劲
I don't even know why I try.

175
00:06:31,551 --> 00:06:33,780
-抱歉 -这个 克莱尔就这德行啊
- Ay. Sorry. - Oh, well, that's just Claire, you know?

176
00:06:33,780 --> 00:06:34,540
普里契特家人都那样
She's a Pritchett.

177
00:06:35,145 --> 00:06:37,060
你得突破那层坚冰
You gotta break through those walls.

178
00:06:37,060 --> 00:06:37,900
越早越好
The sooner the better.

179
00:06:38,140 --> 00:06:39,220
你真这么觉得吗
You really think so?

180
00:06:39,300 --> 00:06:41,300
没错 为什么不去呢 快走
Yeah. Why don't you go? Now.

181
00:06:41,660 --> 00:06:42,660
搭建友谊的桥梁
Forge that friendship!

182
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:45,320
好 我去 我的健身包就在车里
Okay, I go. I have my gym bag in the car.

183
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,640
快好起来哦
Feel better!

184
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:49,161
好的 谢啦 我就趴在这儿
Okay, thank you! I'm just gonna lie here...

185
00:06:49,980 --> 00:06:51,420
敷点冰块
Some ice on my back!

186
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,940
克莱尔根本没还我保鲜盒
I knew for a fact Claire never returned my Tupperware.

187
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:05,140
我只是需要点时间找找
I just needed a few minutes alone to find it.

188
00:07:05,140 --> 00:07:06,020
等我找到
And when I did,

189
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:08,660
他们就再也不会偷笑了
I'd never have to hear them snicker again,

190
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:11,260
说什么"糊涂的小卡"或者"小卡忘性真大"
"Oh, silly Cam" or "forgetful Cam,"

191
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:14,360
因为君子报仇 十年不晚
because revenge is a dish best served cold.

192
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:16,320
而且更狠的是 两天后她就会发现
And even better, two days later

193
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:18,228
失去24盎司微波炉适用的
out of 24-ounce microwave-friendly

194
00:07:18,228 --> 00:07:20,167
气密封口保鲜盒有多可怕
burp-sealed pak-n-stor.

195
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:33,220
嘿 我还以为你去药房了呢
Oh, hey! I thought you were going to the pharmacy.

196
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:34,500
忘带手机了
I forgot my phone.

197
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:38,480
我觉得我还在为跟我爸的那蠢事烦神
I think I'm just upset about this stupid thing with my dad.

198
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:40,040
亲爱的 我愿意听你娓娓道来
Well, sweetie, I'd love to hear about it

199
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,740
不过你得先帮我买暖宝宝去
when you come back with my heating pad from the pharmacy,

200
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:42,960
因为我背好疼 好吗
because I hurt my back, remember?

201
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:45,499
我说 他是不是反应过度了啊
I mean, did he overreact or what?

202
00:07:45,780 --> 00:07:47,340
就是个游戏嘛 对吧
It's just a game, right?

203
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,400
除非有其他更深层次的意义
Well, unless there's something more to it.

204
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:52,020
或许你应该跟他谈谈
Maybe you should go talk to him.

205
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:52,740
或许吧
Yeah.

206
00:07:54,300 --> 00:07:55,800
唉 早知道就不提那事了
Oh, I should have just kept my mouth shut.

207
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:57,400
那天多美好啊
I mean, it was such a great day.

208
00:07:57,474 --> 00:07:59,377
在他以为自己一杆进洞后
After he thought he got that hole-in-one,

209
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:00,620
他带我们下馆子
he took us out to dinner.

210
00:08:01,020 --> 00:08:02,440
给我买了人生中第一瓶啤酒
He bought me my first beer.

211
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:04,100
这不就对了 他也许就气在
Well, there you go. He's probably hurt

212
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:06,633
你毁了一段特殊的父子经历
because you marred a very special father-son experience.

213
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,220
-是吗 -你毁了它
- You think? - You marred it.

214
00:08:08,580 --> 00:08:09,920
但你可以修补啊
But you can fix it.

215
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,960
他现在就在俱乐部呢
He's down at the club right now.

216
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,240
去吧 米奇尔
Go, Mitchell!

217
00:08:13,567 --> 00:08:15,004
修补那段回忆
Un-mar that memory!

218
00:08:15,004 --> 00:08:16,985
你知道吗 我要去
You know what? I'm gonna do it.

219
00:08:16,985 --> 00:08:18,324
-疼 -抱歉
- Ow. - Sorry.

220
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:19,820
别担心 我马上就回来
Don't worry. I'll be back soon.

221
00:08:19,820 --> 00:08:20,980
好的 我会想你的
Okay! I'll miss you!

222
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:21,780
回来前打电话啊
Call first.

223
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,820
你当着他的面说那些话 有脑子吗你
What were you thinking saying that in front of him?

224
00:08:32,020 --> 00:08:33,420
抱歉 说溜嘴了
I'm sorry. It slipped out.

225
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:34,840
况且 我觉得他早知道了
Besides, I figured he knew.

226
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:35,520
妈早知道了
Mom knows.

227
00:08:35,560 --> 00:08:37,360
那也是她威逼利诱迪兰才知道的
Only because she dragged it out of Dylan.

228
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:40,180
而且她保证过在我上大学前不告诉老爸的
And she promised not to tell dad until I left for college,

229
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:42,860
也就是说本来可以一直瞒着他
Which means he might have never found out.

230
00:08:44,140 --> 00:08:44,940
别慌了
Stop panicking.

231
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,860
我们都不确定他是否听清楚了我的话
We don't even know for sure he heard what I said.

232
00:08:46,860 --> 00:08:48,720
好了 已经有护士在照顾碧翠丝了
Okay. Beatrice is with the nurse.

233
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,100
有事他们会叫我们的 应该不会太久
They'll call us. Shouldn't be too long.

234
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:51,380
我们等着吧 等到她结婚
We can just wait until she's married.

235
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:53,400
等到她准备好
Until she's... ready.

236
00:08:53,860 --> 00:08:55,600
当然啦 现在的年轻人都是"时刻准备着"
Which, apparently, everyone is these days.

237
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,160
有意思的是
Funny,

238
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,960
我以为人家要到好几年后才会准备好呢
I used to think it'd be years until everyone was ready,

239
00:08:58,020 --> 00:09:00,040
但我猜我错了 很傻很天真地错了
but I guess I was wrong. Wrong and naive.

240
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:04,600
惊喜哟
Surprise!

241
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:06,600
歌洛莉亚 天啊
Oh! Gloria. My god.

242
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,780
我来和你一起练瑜伽
I came to do yoga with you.

243
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:10,420
我真没想到你会来呢
I wasn't expecting to see you here.

244
00:09:10,420 --> 00:09:12,360
对啊 所以我才会说惊喜哟
Yeah, that's why I say "Surprise!"

245
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:14,760
是啊 太不巧了 因为我刚刚想起来
Oh, yeah. This is awful, because I was just thinking

246
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,340
我好像得翘瑜伽课了
I might have to bail on yoga.

247
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,500
我突然间头痛的好厉害啊
I have the worst headache all of a sudden.

248
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:20,488
但是瑜伽对头痛很好啊 克莱尔
Oh, but yoga is good for that, Claire.

249
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:22,340
有冥想啊 还有那种哼哼叫啊
For the meditation, for the mmm...

250
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,240
是 是 只是现在
Yeah, yeah. It's just right now

251
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:27,020
我真的只想在漆黑的屋子里躺下来深呼吸
I wanna go lie down in a dark room and breathe.

252
00:09:27,260 --> 00:09:28,260
听起来和瑜伽没什么区别嘛
That sounds like yoga.

253
00:09:28,273 --> 00:09:30,180
这 这倒是
I... I realize that.

254
00:09:30,180 --> 00:09:30,860
是没什么区别
Yes.

255
00:09:30,860 --> 00:09:33,063
-但是 我得走了 -拜托
- But still, I-I... should go. - Come on.

256
00:09:33,162 --> 00:09:35,177
人家才不要一个人上瑜伽课嘛
I'm not gonna do the class by myself.

257
00:09:35,177 --> 00:09:37,400
那好 那我们去做个按摩吧
Okay, so let's go and get massages.

258
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:39,240
或者去这的一家美甲沙龙
or there's a nail salon there.

259
00:09:39,380 --> 00:09:40,960
改天有时间的话我肯定特想去
Ooh, I would love to do that some other time,

260
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,220
我真的特想去 但是现在
I really would. But right now

261
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:45,060
我得回家躺着了 你能理解我 对吧
I need to get home and lie down. You understand, right?

262
00:09:45,060 --> 00:09:46,374
-当然理解 -好的
- Of course. - Okay.

263
00:09:47,285 --> 00:09:48,275
走吧
You go!

264
00:09:49,540 --> 00:09:50,340
你就满嘴谎话吧
And lie.

265
00:09:53,460 --> 00:09:54,300
你好了
You're better!

266
00:09:54,900 --> 00:09:55,980
稍有起色 稍有
Barely. Barely, yeah.

267
00:09:55,980 --> 00:09:58,400
我刚刚只是想拿点凉东西敷背
I was just getting something cold for my back.

268
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,040
拿肉汁敷
Gravy?

269
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,809
如果它能拯救你妈的火鸡
Well, if it can save your mom's turkey,

270
00:10:00,820 --> 00:10:01,600
它就能治好所有东西
it can save anything.

271
00:10:01,980 --> 00:10:03,580
你们不是要去见你朋友米兰达吗
I thought you were going to see your friend Miranda.

272
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,100
这货胆怯了
This one chickened out.

273
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,440
亏他还说自己非常喜欢女生
For someone who says he likes girls so much,

274
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,740
怕女生还差不多
he sure is afraid of them.

275
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:10,340
那可是要跟她跳舞啊 卢克
It's a dance, Luke.

276
00:10:10,340 --> 00:10:11,200
懦夫舞吧
Chicken dance.

277
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,680
既然你们都回来了
Well, since you're back,

278
00:10:13,180 --> 00:10:14,960
如果我给你们二十块钱
what if I give you 20 bucks,

279
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,440
你们俩
and you guys...

280
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,480
给我把车洗了怎么样
go wash my car?

281
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:22,840
是每人二十 还是总共二十
Is that 20 bucks for each of us, or both of us?

282
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:23,280
总共二十
Both.

283
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:26,060
我就知道他没那么大方
That's what I thought.

284
00:10:34,457 --> 00:10:35,400
瞧瞧啊
Uh-oh, check it out.

285
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:36,880
"高手"又在盯着光荣榜呢
Ace is drooling over his plaque again.

286
00:10:36,940 --> 00:10:39,500
抱歉 我还真没闻见你们几个二货进来
Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't smell you idiots come in.

287
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:41,300
听着 我一直在想
Listen, I've been thinking,

288
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:43,580
或许还是别叫我"高手"了吧
maybe it's time we retire the name "Ace."

289
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:45,920
你是说你印在高尔夫球帽上的字吗
You mean the name you had printed on your golf cap?

290
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,920
-还有浴袍上 -其实 关于那个
- And his robe. - You know, guys, about that--

291
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:50,540
还记得我把他那帽子扯下来戴我头上
Remember how mad he got when I yanked that cap off his head

292
00:10:50,540 --> 00:10:51,100
他怎么发飙的吗
and put it on?

293
00:10:51,113 --> 00:10:52,388
你得自己赢取一顶光荣帽
You got to earn that!

294
00:10:52,388 --> 00:10:53,820
是是是 我只是很庆幸
Yeah, yeah, well, I'm just glad

295
00:10:53,820 --> 00:10:56,100
你那便宜的植发没卡进我帽子里
one of those cheap hair plugs didn't get caught in it.

296
00:10:56,100 --> 00:10:58,180
说过多少次了 那不是植发
Hey, for the millionth time, they're not plugs.

297
00:10:58,180 --> 00:11:00,200
那是啥 你头发在你五十岁时又回来了
So what, your hair just came back when you turned 50?

298
00:11:00,260 --> 00:11:01,300
反正你老婆是没回来
Unlike your wife.

299
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:02,580
拜托 她不回来才好呢
Hey, that was a blessing.

300
00:11:02,590 --> 00:11:04,926
否则 我今晚还约不了娜塔莉·霍布斯呢
Otherwise, I wouldn't be taking out Natalie Hobbes tonight.

301
00:11:04,926 --> 00:11:06,680
出去吃饭还是帮人报税啊
Taking her out or doing her taxes?

302
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:08,120
我正想怎么澄清我那
So I'm trying to find a way to come clean

303
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:10,142
一杆进洞的囧事时 我突然间想
about the hole-in-one, when it occurs to me...

304
00:11:10,860 --> 00:11:11,380
澄清毛啊
Why?

305
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:14,360
一个二货对他的性生活鬼话连篇
One idiot lies about his sex life,

306
00:11:14,580 --> 00:11:18,100
另一个傻缺的法拉利都"在保养"N年了
the other dumbbell has a ferrari "In the shop" for years,

307
00:11:18,100 --> 00:11:21,800
而三号二货是个好莱坞特技车手
and moron number three is a hollywood stunt car driver

308
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:25,100
而他却在倒高尔夫车时受伤了
who gets sick when he rides backwards in the golf cart.

309
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:28,080
那女士们准备好开球还是干嘛啊
So you ladies ready to tee off or what?

310
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:30,380
-我们付清酒钱就行动 -我付了
- Yeah, just gotta settle up our tab. - I took care of it.

311
00:11:30,500 --> 00:11:31,640
你说你去洗手间的
You said you were going to the restroom.

312
00:11:32,060 --> 00:11:33,880
这家伙真是没一句真话
Ah! Can't trust a word out of this guy's mouth.

313
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:35,576
都骗了我们二十年了
20 years we've been falling for this.

314
00:11:35,576 --> 00:11:36,989
我 我抱歉打扰一下
I-I'm sorry to interrupt,

315
00:11:36,989 --> 00:11:39,512
-但是我老爸从没骗过你们 -米奇尔
- but my dad never lied to you guys. - Mitchell...

316
00:11:39,512 --> 00:11:40,852
直到今天他才知道
No, he didn't even know until today

317
00:11:40,852 --> 00:11:42,600
-他从没打出一杆进洞 -这下可好
- that he never made the hole-in-one. - Okay.

318
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,560
但是事实上他知道真相后
But the fact that he couldn't live with himself

319
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:45,580
他受不了良心的责备
when he found out,

320
00:11:45,580 --> 00:11:48,040
马不停蹄地过来向你们坦白
and he raced down here to confess to you,

321
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:50,000
这就足以说明他是个真男人
that just shows the kind of man he is.

322
00:11:50,170 --> 00:11:52,559
他是个一杆进洞型的男人
He is a hole-in-one kind of man.

323
00:11:53,535 --> 00:11:55,340
你从没打出一杆进洞
You never got a hole-in-one?

324
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:56,640
我还没坦白呢
I didn't tell them.

325
00:11:57,977 --> 00:11:59,780
这么说 这就是你的兄弟帮哈
So this is the gang.

326
00:11:59,780 --> 00:12:01,080
介绍介绍呗
Introduce me.

327
00:12:03,543 --> 00:12:05,949
中奖了
Ahh. Score!

328
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:08,940
我和米兰达好像不是天生一对
It's not like me and Miranda are perfectly suited.

329
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,380
首先 她喜欢古惑仔类型
For one thing, she likes bad boys.

330
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:11,420
我又不是
That's just not me.

331
00:12:11,420 --> 00:12:13,360
我要开音乐了
I'm gonna turn on some music.

332
00:12:13,540 --> 00:12:14,260
抱歉
I'm sorry.

333
00:12:14,260 --> 00:12:16,320
对女人温柔的本事我又甩不掉
I can't unlearn how to treat a lady.

334
00:12:16,580 --> 00:12:17,600
最后又会怎么样呢
But where does that leave me?

335
00:12:17,660 --> 00:12:19,740
等到了四十岁 她第一次离婚后
Waiting till I'm 40 when she looks me up on facebook

336
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:21,380
在Fackbook上找我吗
after a failed first marriage?

337
00:12:21,380 --> 00:12:21,780
好啦
Okay.

338
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,340
你在干什么
What are you doing?

339
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:26,580
我受够你对米兰达那些怨念了
I'm sick of hearing you whine about Miranda!

340
00:12:26,780 --> 00:12:29,000
-现在去让她注意你 -但我们没办法
- It's time to make her notice you! - But we can't!

341
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:31,060
我们有一整箱汽油 她就住在街角
We got a full tank of gas, and she's right down the block.

342
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,020
系上安全带
Now buckle up!

343
00:12:32,100 --> 00:12:34,060
-你疯了吗 -你说呢
- Are you crazy? - You tell me.

344
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:49,960
莉莉 这是什么
Lily, what is this?

345
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:51,880
化学仪器玩具套装不是更好吗
Wouldn't you rather have a chemistry set,

346
00:12:51,953 --> 00:12:53,776
或是看图识字卡
or some flash cards?

347
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,340
她很漂亮
She's pretty.

348
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,620
不 她脏了
No, she's dirty.

349
00:12:57,620 --> 00:12:59,515
来 把灰擦一擦
Look. Get the dirt.

350
00:12:59,702 --> 00:13:01,261
我来把她擦干净
So let me wipe her off.

351
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,280
搞定
Fix that.

352
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:06,880
你的辫子松了 过来这儿
Your braid's coming loose. Come here.

353
00:13:09,060 --> 00:13:10,420
立马搞定
Fix that right up.

354
00:13:10,940 --> 00:13:13,960
我做了检查
So I completed the examination.

355
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,220
她情况还不错
She did really well.

356
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,160
诊断结果呢
What's the prognosis?

357
00:13:16,500 --> 00:13:18,560
我们能大致修复手臂
We can fix most of her arm,

358
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:22,520
但她的肩关节无法完全恢复灵活度
but she'll never regain full mobility in her shoulder joint,

359
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:24,760
因为工厂不再生产那种零件了
because they don't make that part anymore.

360
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,460
挺不错的了 是吧
Well, that's pretty good, right?

361
00:13:26,460 --> 00:13:28,220
至少看上去还是一样
I mean, she'll look exactly the same.

362
00:13:28,220 --> 00:13:28,920
没人会知道
No one will know.

363
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:29,797
我知道
I'll know.

364
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:33,700
我只是喜欢她以前的模样
I'm just saying I liked her the way she was.

365
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:35,309
多可爱的甜心娃娃
She was such a sweet little doll.

366
00:13:36,366 --> 00:13:37,160
对不起 医生
I'm sorry, doctor.

367
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:39,187
我有点适应问题
I'm having trouble adjusting to all this.

368
00:13:39,220 --> 00:13:41,560
爸 她还是那个可爱的甜心娃娃
Uh, dad, she's still a sweet little doll.

369
00:13:41,660 --> 00:13:42,680
不 她已经"破"了
No, she's broken.

370
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:45,820
不 她只是改变了一点
No, she's just changed a little.

371
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,840
生活就是这样 娃娃会长大的
It happens. Dolls grow up.

372
00:13:48,060 --> 00:13:49,460
事实上
Well, actually--

373
00:13:49,460 --> 00:13:51,323
-劳驾 -当然
- Uh, could you... - Yeah. Sure.

374
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:52,560
我正要去
I actually have to go

375
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:54,420
将噩耗告诉一个小女孩
give a little girl some pretty bad news.

376
00:14:00,900 --> 00:14:01,780
海莉
So, Haley...

377
00:14:02,500 --> 00:14:05,320
我想说的是...
The thing is...

378
00:14:06,086 --> 00:14:07,949
其实 海莉已经快18了
Fact--Haley's almost 18.

379
00:14:08,017 --> 00:14:10,153
其实 我是个酷老爸
Fact--I am the cool dad.

380
00:14:11,540 --> 00:14:14,260
海莉 我理解性是生活的一部分
Haley, I understand that sex is a part of life.

381
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,800
虽然听到这个消息我并不开心
I can't say that I'm thrilled to hear this,

382
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:18,260
但我肯定你有注意"安全" 只要你乐意
but I'm sure you're being safe, and I hope that you'll feel free

383
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:19,974
随时都可以跟我谈论这个问题
to talk to me about this anytime.

384
00:14:23,380 --> 00:14:24,260
我们应该
We should...

385
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:25,980
我们应该为碧翠丝打上
We should probably get Beatrice, like,

386
00:14:25,980 --> 00:14:26,819
石膏什么的
a-a cast or something,

387
00:14:26,819 --> 00:14:29,652
这样大家可以尽情涂鸦了
and we can all sign it. Yeah?

388
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:31,580
当然 当然
Uh, yeah. Sure.

389
00:14:31,659 --> 00:14:34,233
其实 我说砸了
Fact--I blew it.

390
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,720
修复工作可能还要一阵
This repair's probably gonna take a little while.

391
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:39,820
你去美食广场给我们找张桌子
Why don't you run up to the food court and grab us a table?

392
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,840
我去接艾丽克斯和莉莉
I'll get Alex and Lily.

393
00:14:41,820 --> 00:14:42,240
好的
Okay.

394
00:14:45,220 --> 00:14:46,760
要吧台位还是卡座
Do you want the counter or a booth?

395
00:14:48,620 --> 00:14:51,400
你觉得好就行
Whatever seems right to you.

396
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:54,400
我相信你
I trust you.

397
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:00,280
我有个酷老爸
I have a cool dad.

398
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,680
好 该你了
Okay. Your turn.

399
00:15:06,721 --> 00:15:08,039
不行
Unh-unh! No way!

400
00:15:08,091 --> 00:15:09,893
你到底要不要她注意你
Do you wanna get her attention, or not?

401
00:15:27,740 --> 00:15:29,200
太赞了
That was amazing!

402
00:15:29,620 --> 00:15:31,160
你看到米兰达的表情了吗
Did you see the look on Miranda's face?

403
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:33,880
没有 但你做得不错 西尔玛
No. But you did good, Thelma.

404
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:36,060
别这么叫我 我讨厌那电影
Please stop calling me that. I hate that movie.

405
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:37,200
什么电影
What movie?

406
00:15:38,351 --> 00:15:39,979
天 到头了
Uh-oh! Dead end!

407
00:15:40,293 --> 00:15:41,520
你得调个头
You gotta make a u-ey.

408
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:42,920
我不知道怎么做
I don't know how to do that.

409
00:15:54,349 --> 00:15:55,920
她假装头疼 小卡
She pretended to have a headache, Cam.

410
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:57,800
她不想和我在一起
She doesn't want to spend time with me.

411
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:59,780
可能她只是想一个人待着
Maybe she just wanted to be alone.

412
00:15:59,994 --> 00:16:01,211
为什么
Why?

413
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:02,300
因为有些人
Because some people

414
00:16:02,300 --> 00:16:04,380
非常重视隐私
really value their privacy,

415
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:06,400
你必须得尊重这点
and you have to respect that.

416
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:10,040
我得挂了
I have to go.

417
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:11,320
好啊 克莱尔
Hola, Claire!

418
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:14,480
歌洛莉亚 你不能再这样了
Gloria, you've gotta stop doing that!

419
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:17,220
你想自己回去上瑜伽课 不带上我吗
Were you going back to the yoga class without me?

420
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:19,500
不 我不是因为这个回来的
No, that is not why I came back.

421
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:20,960
真搞不懂你
I don't understand you.

422
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:22,940
为什么你不想和我在一起
Why you don't want to spend time with me?

423
00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:24,820
所有人都喜欢和我在一起
Everybody wants to spend time with me!

424
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:26,780
就连给我做指甲的女士
Even the lady that did my nails

425
00:16:26,780 --> 00:16:28,060
都想带我去上普拉提课
wants to take me to pilates.

426
00:16:28,160 --> 00:16:29,360
我不是回来上瑜伽课的
I didn't come back here to do yoga.

427
00:16:30,020 --> 00:16:32,220
我不做瑜伽 只是个掩饰 好吗
I don't do yoga. It's a cover, okay?

428
00:16:32,340 --> 00:16:32,660
听着
Look...

429
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:35,440
我知道在外人看来
I know that from the outside,

430
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:37,540
我生活美满 一切尽在掌握
it seems like I have everything together.

431
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,760
不 我没觉得啊
No, not really.

432
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:42,000
我想说我有时压力很大
My point is that my life can be very stressful.

433
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,120
我找了个放松的方式
And I have found a way to cope with that stress.

434
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:48,280
这是我的小秘密 我知道这不是什么光荣的事
And it's my little secret. And I'm not proud of it.

435
00:16:48,300 --> 00:16:49,640
你好 克莱尔 里面见
Hey, Claire. See you inside.

436
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:51,900
你是在搞外遇吗
Is that what you do?

437
00:16:52,470 --> 00:16:54,064
不 不是
No. No!

438
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:57,380
好吧 你跟我进来 来
Okay. You're coming with me. Come in.

439
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,440
但听着 歌洛莉亚
But listen to me. Gloria...

440
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:01,860
此事只能天知地知你知我知
It has to stay between us.

441
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:05,240
这儿是我的圣地
This is my sacred space.

442
00:17:09,300 --> 00:17:12,180
浑身的压力都释放出来了
It's just such a great release.

443
00:17:12,500 --> 00:17:14,600
-多谢你没用有色眼光看我 -怎么会呢
- Thank you for not judging me. - Why would I?

444
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:16,740
就算有 也是让我更喜欢你了
If anything, it makes me like you more.

445
00:17:16,786 --> 00:17:18,240
你多久来一次
So how often do you come here?

446
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,580
也不是经常来
Not that often. No.

447
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:21,020
你好
Hey.

448
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:22,980
可能是有点小经常吧
Maybe a little often.

449
00:17:23,180 --> 00:17:24,180
太可悲了
That's so sad.

450
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:25,880
我有仨孩子加一幼稚老公
I live with four teenagers.

451
00:17:26,080 --> 00:17:27,400
你家连儿子都那么成熟
You live with two adults.

452
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,580
-你不了解 -不不 我说你可悲是因为
- You have no idea... - No, no, no. It's so sad

453
00:17:28,580 --> 00:17:29,900
你经常来
that you come here so often

454
00:17:29,900 --> 00:17:31,653
枪法就这水平
and that's the best that you can shoot.

455
00:17:34,390 --> 00:17:35,915
指甲未剪 枪法也比你神勇
And that's with pretty nails.

456
00:17:35,915 --> 00:17:37,180
但是姿势不对 我...
But improper stance. I...

457
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:38,240
-多练练吧 -好的
- Practice more. - Okay.

458
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:39,880
你的酒 "高手"
Here you go, Ace...

459
00:17:40,420 --> 00:17:42,660
你真名叫什么
I mean... What is your real name?

460
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:43,060
杰
Jay.

461
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:48,260
-爸 -我说了 别提了
- Dad, I-- - I told you, forget about it.

462
00:17:48,899 --> 00:17:51,424
好吧 我只想让你知道
All right. I-I just want you to know

463
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:53,280
我明白你为什么生气
I get why you're upset, okay?

464
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:55,280
你打出一杆进洞的那天
That--that day you got the hole-in-one,

465
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:56,240
对你来说意义重大
it meant a lot to you.

466
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:59,460
全被我破坏了
And... I... I marred it.

467
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:02,360
那天对我也有重大意义
But it meant a lot to me, too.

468
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:05,220
我们吃了牛排大餐 你让我喝了人生第一瓶啤酒
We had a steak dinner, you gave me my first beer,

469
00:18:05,220 --> 00:18:05,640
而且
and, uh...

470
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:08,920
那是我们一起度过的非常美好的一天
It was one of the greatest days we ever spent together.

471
00:18:09,096 --> 00:18:11,480
那天不应该是关于毫无意义的一杆进洞
And it wasn't about some meaningless hole-in-one,

472
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:12,920
而是我们的美好回忆
it was about us.

473
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:14,982
不 那天的意义就在于一杆进洞
No. It was about a hole-in-one.

474
00:18:15,576 --> 00:18:17,660
是的 也许有一点关系吧
Yes. Yes. A-a little bit, maybe.

475
00:18:17,660 --> 00:18:19,660
更重要的是 我们父子的感情加深了
But mostly, it was about how we bonded.

476
00:18:20,060 --> 00:18:23,480
我以为我将球从球座击出
I thought I hit a ball straight from the tee

477
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:25,260
飞了很远很远
really, really far

478
00:18:25,260 --> 00:18:26,740
进了一个小洞里
into a tiny hole.

479
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:28,520
好吧
Okay.

480
00:18:28,686 --> 00:18:30,594
我又自讨没趣了
Well, when will I learn?

481
00:18:34,398 --> 00:18:35,740
而且那不是你第一次喝啤酒
And it wasn't your first beer, anyway.

482
00:18:35,740 --> 00:18:37,880
是的 爸 不过我也不指望你能记得
Yes, it was, dad, but I wouldn't expect you to remember.

483
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:40,020
你14岁生日时
It was your 14th birthday.

484
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,880
你想喝一口我的啤酒
You asked me for a sip of mine.

485
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:45,200
你妈当着你所有朋友的面吼你
Your mom yelled at you in front of all your friends,

486
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,360
说你还只是个小屁孩
said you were just a baby.

487
00:18:47,300 --> 00:18:49,220
你含泪跑了出去
You ran outside in tears...

488
00:18:49,220 --> 00:18:51,600
不幸的是 以事实证明你妈是对的
Which, unfortunately, supported your mom's argument.

489
00:18:52,660 --> 00:18:54,740
总之 我拿着啤酒出去
Anyway, I came out with a couple of beers.

490
00:18:55,424 --> 00:18:57,147
我们在门廊里喝的
We drank 'em on the porch

491
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:59,480
看着头上乌云袭来
watching the storm clouds coming in.

492
00:19:01,940 --> 00:19:03,920
我完全忘记那事了
I had completely forgotten about that.

493
00:19:05,249 --> 00:19:06,611
你真是不可思议
You know, you're-- you're unbelievable.

494
00:19:06,611 --> 00:19:09,225
-就在我觉得你是...-风暴·史蒂文 没错
- Just when I peg you as some-- - Storm Stevens! That's it!

495
00:19:09,824 --> 00:19:11,426
给我个可以写字的 我要马上写下来
Give me something. I'm gonna write it right here.

496
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:14,140
免得我忘记了 风暴·史蒂文
Before I forget. "Storm Stevens."

497
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:18,000
刚刚我们说什么来着
What were we just talking about? Just now?

498
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:20,240
没什么吗
No?

499
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:24,020
来吧 莉莉 去看看碧翠丝修好没
Come on, Lily. Let's see if Beatrice is ready.

500
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:30,440
爸
Hey, dad?

501
00:19:30,780 --> 00:19:33,180
我知道自己已经不小了
I know I'm way too old for this,

502
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:35,120
可你能买这个娃娃给我吗
but do you think I could get this doll?

503
00:19:35,500 --> 00:19:36,440
她叫吉纳薇
Her name's Genevieve,

504
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:38,460
她正在开发一种疫苗
and she's developing a vaccine for...

505
00:19:38,460 --> 00:19:39,160
可以 我会买给你
Yes, you can get the doll.

506
00:19:39,180 --> 00:19:40,980
你要多少我就买多少
You can get as many dolls as you want.

507
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:43,360
200块一个
It's $200.

508
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:44,780
一个就够了
Or one is fine.

509
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:49,780
我知道你就在这屋子里
I know you're here.

510
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:52,700
你们好呀
Hello.

511
00:19:57,960 --> 00:20:00,100
我有个不好的预感
I have a bad feeling about this.

512
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:01,720
万一你的邻居看见了咱们怎么办
What if one of your neighbors saw us?

513
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:03,100
我们还是老实交待吧
Maybe we should just confess.

514
00:20:03,340 --> 00:20:03,960
会的
We will...

515
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:05,900
二十年后
in 20 years.

516
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:06,580
什么
Huh?

517
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:09,420
你没听外公说吗 诉讼有时效的
You heard grandpa. There's a statute of limitations,

518
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:10,480
这可是件好事
Which is a good thing

519
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:12,900
因为我们还得把莉莉给灭了
because we still need to take Lily down.

520
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:14,680
算了 "萌娃宝座"给她吧
Nah, let her be the cute one.

521
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:15,780
我们不需要卖萌讨欢心了
We don't need that anymore.

522
00:20:16,060 --> 00:20:17,480
咱现在是古惑仔了
We're bad boys now.

523
00:20:18,260 --> 00:20:20,420
没错 这名号多响亮
Yeah. I like that.

524
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:21,640
古惑仔
Bad boys.

525
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:23,540
是你妈
Your mom!

526
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:30,520
天呐
Oh, my god.

527
00:20:31,620 --> 00:20:32,160
小卡
Cam!

528
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:35,020
这个本来有盖的好吧
Um, this had a lid?

529
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:42,120
回见了 我去艾比家
I'll see you guys later. I'm going to Abby's.

530
00:20:42,540 --> 00:20:43,480
拜 亲爱的 玩得开心点
Bye, honey. Have fun.

531
00:20:43,660 --> 00:20:45,820
玩得开心点 和艾比一起
Have fun, you! With Abby!

532
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:49,200
确定有艾比这个人 而且是女生吗
We've confirmed Abby's a real person and a female?

533
00:20:49,360 --> 00:20:50,640
是的 亲爱的 我们见过的
Yes, sweetie. We met her.

534
00:20:51,700 --> 00:20:54,480
老公 不能因为我们知道了海莉的事
Honey, we can't treat Haley differently

535
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:56,660
就对她另眼相看
just because we both know what we know about her.

536
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,960
我知道 我只是需要些时间适应
I know. I just need time.

537
00:21:01,380 --> 00:21:02,880
迪兰告诉你了
So Dylan told you?

538
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:05,640
他为什么不告诉我 我们以前可是无话不谈
Why didn't he tell me? He and I used to share everything.

539
00:21:06,020 --> 00:21:07,780
别自寻烦恼了
You're upset about a lot of things.

540
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:10,400
好吧 我不再纠结就是了
Okay, I won't obsess over it.

541
00:21:11,372 --> 00:21:12,817
我只想问一件事
I just wanna ask you one thing.

542
00:21:13,980 --> 00:21:15,100
你知道这事多久了
How long have you known?

543
00:21:16,740 --> 00:21:17,500
三个月
Three months.

544
00:21:18,263 --> 00:21:21,520
我家大闺女发生了这么惊天动地的事
So this giant thing happened to our first born,

545
00:21:21,520 --> 00:21:24,320
你却整整瞒了我三个月
and you kept me in the dark about it for three whole months?

546
00:21:24,320 --> 00:21:26,831
抱歉 我只是不确定你能否接受
I'm sorry. I just wasn't sure how you'd--okay.

547
00:21:27,100 --> 00:21:28,040
谢谢
Thank you.
